      <title>Jensen Huang resigns as Nvidia CEO after 33 years, effective immediately - CFO Colette Kress steps in as interim CEO with earnings Tuesday</title>
      <link>https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/12/jensen-huang-is-out-at-nvidia-who-is-colette-kress-his-interim-replacement/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/12/jensen-huang-is-out-at-nvidia-who-is-colette-kress-his-interim-replacement/</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 07:37:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>AI &amp; Agents</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://techcrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/colette-1920x1920_4d360fa4-e97d-4505-9857-284d03141162-prv-e1794568317250.jpg?w=1024" alt="Nvidia interim CEO Colette Kress" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>The board announced the co-founder's exit as president, CEO and director Thursday morning. TechCrunch reports he was ousted after reports of affairs with an alleged Chinese spy and a direct report. Kress, CFO since 2013, leads the ~$3.8 trillion company with no succession plan in place.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;We will continue advancing the work that has made Nvidia a leader in accelerated computing and AI, and execute on the opportunities ahead.&rdquo; - <a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/12/jensen-huang-is-out-at-nvidia-who-is-colette-kress-his-interim-replacement/">Colette Kress, Nvidia interim CEO</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/12/jensen-huang-is-out-at-nvidia-who-is-colette-kress-his-interim-replacement/">TechCrunch</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/11/13/nx-s1-6038889/colette-kress-becomes-nvidias-interim-ceo-after-jensen-huang-resigns">NPR</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-11-13/nvidia-founder-jensen-huang-resigns/107376470">ABC News</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/13%3A%20loved%20%22Jensen%20Huang%20resigns%20as%20Nvidia%20CEO%20afte...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/13%3A%20meh%20on%20%22Jensen%20Huang%20resigns%20as%20Nvidia%20CEO%20afte...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/13%3A%20less%20like%20%22Jensen%20Huang%20resigns%20as%20Nvidia%20CEO%20afte...%22">Less of this</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=https%3A//techcrunch.com/2026/11/12/jensen-huang-is-out-at-nvidia-who-is-colette-kress-his-interim-replacement/%0A">Chat about it</a></p>]]></description>
