      <title>ChatGPT Wallet: agents can now pay with network-issued tokens - no card details shared, biometric approval on every purchase</title>
      <link>https://openai.com/index/introducing-chatgpt-wallet/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://openai.com/index/introducing-chatgpt-wallet/</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 06:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>AI &amp; Agents</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><b>Built with Amex, Mastercard and Visa; rolls out today in dots for US ChatGPT Pro subscribers. OpenAI also published a Commerce Partner Playbook: claim your business, allow signed Web Bot Auth requests, and teach risk systems (Forter, Riskified, Stripe, Adyen) not to decline agent purchases.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;ChatGPT Wallet marks our first American Express Agentic Commerce Experiences integration, enabling eligible Card Members to use their Amex Card while reviewing and approving each purchase.&rdquo; - <a href="https://openai.com/index/introducing-chatgpt-wallet/">Luke Gebb, EVP, American Express</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://openai.com/index/introducing-chatgpt-wallet/">OpenAI</a></p>
