      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://sf.urbanize.city/sites/default/files/styles/2018_article_image_1140x538/public/background/2026-11/unnamed%287%29.jpg?itok=44tbNCvD" alt="Rendering of the Caltrain Portal extension" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>The Portal - a two-mile tunnel from Fourth and King to the Salesforce Transit Center - is a $7.5B+ project. BART got $25M toward turning Ashby Station's west lot into 618 homes (307 affordable); Capitol Corridor got $40M for railcar refits.</b></p>
