      <title>SF now offers buprenorphine on demand at Maria X Martinez in SoMa - same-day first dose from clinicians patients already know</title>
      <link>https://www.sfchronicle.com/sf/article/buprenorphine-drug-addiction-medication-22521868.php</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.sfchronicle.com/sf/article/buprenorphine-drug-addiction-medication-22521868.php</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 05:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>San Francisco</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><b>The ~$500K pilot (from Lurie's privately financed Breaking the Cycle Fund) targets a hard math problem: 2,800 shots given last year against ~37,500 San Franciscans with drug addiction, and only ~30% of patients stay on the medication six months.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;Often, no matter whether it's treatment, shelter or housing, we lose people very quickly. So if somebody is ready, we get them in a vehicle, and we drive them straight here, and that opens a gateway to all types of other opportunities.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.sfchronicle.com/sf/article/buprenorphine-drug-addiction-medication-22521868.php">Mark Mazza, city street outreach supervisor</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://www.sfchronicle.com/sf/article/buprenorphine-drug-addiction-medication-22521868.php">SF Chronicle</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/13%3A%20loved%20%22SF%20now%20offers%20buprenorphine%20on%20demand%20a...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/13%3A%20meh%20on%20%22SF%20now%20offers%20buprenorphine%20on%20demand%20a...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/13%3A%20less%20like%20%22SF%20now%20offers%20buprenorphine%20on%20demand%20a...%22">Less of this</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=https%3A//www.sfchronicle.com/sf/article/buprenorphine-drug-addiction-medication-22521868.php%0A">Chat about it</a></p>]]></description>
    </item>
