      <description><![CDATA[<p><b>The 1:59:41 London runner was the only sub-two man in the field; John Korir (2:02:24) now leads it, realistically chasing Lemma's 2:01:48 course record (€30K). Tesfay's 2:10:51 debut makes her the only athlete within a minute of Chepngetich's 2:09:56 - and Ngetich makes her marathon debut.</b></p>
